  "items": [
    {
      "source": "If the property is <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection-like</code></a>, then this attribute holds a single <a href=\"CassandraType.Name.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>DataType Name</code></a> representing the element type of the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果该属性是<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>Collection-like</code></a>，则该属性包含一个<a href=\"CassandraType.Name.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping 中的枚举类\"><code>DataType Name</code></a>，用于表示<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>Collection</code></a>的元素类型。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"CassandraType.Name.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>CassandraType.Name</code></a> of the property.",
      "translation": "该属性的<a href=\"CassandraType.Name.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping 中的枚举类\"><code>CassandraType.Name</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If the property is a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>, then this attribute holds exactly two <a href=\"CassandraType.Name.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>DataType Names</code></a>; the\nfirst is the key type and the second is the value type.",
      "translation": "如果该属性是<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>，则该属性包含恰好两个<a href=\"CassandraType.Name.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>数据类型名称</code></a>；第一个是键类型，第二个是值类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If the property is neither <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection-like</code></a> nor a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>, then this\nattribute is ignored.",
      "translation": "如果该属性既不是 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection-like</code></a> 也不是一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>，则该属性将被忽略。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If the property maps to a User-Defined Type (UDT) then this attribute holds the user type name. For\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection-like</code></a> properties the user type name applies to the component type. For\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> properties, <a href=\"#typeArguments()\"><code>typeArguments()</code></a> configured to <a href=\"CassandraType.Name.html#UDT\"><code>CassandraType.Name.UDT</code></a> are resolved using the\nuser type name. The user type name is only required if the UDT does not map to a class annotated with\n<a href=\"UserDefinedType.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>UserDefinedType</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果属性映射到用户自定义类型（UDT），则该属性包含用户类型名称。对于 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection-like</code></a> 属性，用户类型名称适用于组件类型。对于 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> 属性，若 <a href=\"#typeArguments()\"><code>typeArguments()</code></a> 配置为 <a href=\"CassandraType.Name.html#UDT\"><code>CassandraType.Name.UDT</code></a>，则使用用户类型名称进行解析。仅当 UDT 未映射到带有 <a href=\"UserDefinedType.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>UserDefinedType</code></a> 注解的类时，才需要指定用户类型名称。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Specifies the Cassandra type of the annotated property or parameter when used in query methods.",
      "translation": "在查询方法中使用时，指定注解属性或参数的 Cassandra 类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Cassandra Protocol types.",
      "translation": "Cassandra 协议类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If the property maps to a User-Defined Type (UDT) then this attribute holds the user type name.",
      "translation": "如果该属性映射到用户定义类型（UDT），则此属性包含用户类型名称。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
